  "Title": "AKU-EB SSC composite supplementary examination results announced",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Results of the SSC Composite Supplementary Examinations held by Aga Khan University Examination Board (AKU-EB) in July 2007 were announced at mid night on August 6, 2007.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<p>Results of the SSC Composite Supplementary Examinations held by Aga Khan University Examination Board (AKU-EB) in July 2007 were announced at mid night on August 6, 2007.</p><p>Copies of the results will be couriered to schools by August 7, 2007. Candidates and schools can also access these results online.</p>",
